      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "```c\n GumbleMax(X)_i = MAX(−log(−log(alpha*Uniform(0,1)+beta)+beta) + Xj) \n```",
